1##emote blinks blearily under the bright lights.
1##emote rummages through his pockets.
1##emote pulls out a small notepad.
2##say Ok, this one is a poem by Shel Silverstein..
1##say ..entitled, "Never."
3##ahem
3##say I've never roped a Brahma bull,
1##say I've never fought a duel,
2##say I've never crossed the desert..
1##say ..On a lop-eared, swayback mule,
2##say I've never climbed an idol's nose..
1##say ..To steal a cursed jewel.
2##say I've never gone down with my ship..
1##say ..Into the bubblin' brine,
2##say I've never saved a lion's life..
1##say ..And then had him save mine,
2##say Or screamed ahoooo while swingin' through..
1##say ..The jungle on a vine.
2##say I've never dealt draw poker..
1##say ..In a rowdy lumber camp,
2##say Or got up at the count of nine..
1##say ..To beat the world's champ,
2##say I've never had my picture on..
1##say ..A six-cent postage stamp.
2##say I've never scored a touchdown..
1##say ..On a ninety-nine-yard run,
2##say I've never winged six Daltons..
1##say ..With my dying brother's gun..
1##say ..Or kissed Miz Jane, and rode my hoss..
1##say ..Into the setting sun.
2##say Sometimes I get so depressed..
1##say ..'Bout what I haven't done.
2##bow
1##emote sticks the small notepad back into this pocket.
1##@stop_poem
1##END
